      "drive_plug_length": 11.0
    },
    "wiring_rule": "Wire a 3.5 in drive from the front SATA connector and a 2.5 in drive from the rear one; rear-to-3.5 in only allows a ~9 mm bend. Schematic ports: J21/J22 = port 0, J24/J23 = port 1; which physical connector is which is not in the STEP (check the SATA1/SATA2 silkscreen)."
  },
